---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Stamp from '../components/Stamp.astro';
import Mark from '../components/Mark.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/placeholder/about/portrait.jpg';
---
<SiteLayout title="About" description="MAARU is a creative collective of one. An ever-growing collection of ideas, images, sounds, places and everything else.">
  <article class="about wrap">
    <p class="label about__n">About</p>
    <h1 class="about__statement">A creative collective <i>of one.</i> An ever-growing collection of ideas, images, sounds, places and <span class="circled">everything else<Mark name="circle-gold" class="circled__mark" stretch /></span>.</h1>
    <figure class="about__img">
      <Photo src={portrait} alt="Placeholder for a portrait — a pale wall with a band of window light." sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30vw, 80vw" />
      <figcaption class="label">Frame 01 — placeholder</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="about__text">
      <p>MAARU is where I keep the things I notice. It started in Harrow and wanders out from there — to Kutchh, to Nairobi, to the record shops and stairwells and bus routes in between.</p>
      <p>There is no plan and no niche. Some of it is finished, most of it is not. Photographs sit next to half an idea about shop bells. A list of records sits next to a diary from a beach. That is the point: a collection, not a portfolio.</p>
      <p>If something here made you look twice at your own street, it worked.</p>
      {/* To add a contact link, uncomment and set a real address:
      <p class="about__contact"><span class="label">Say hello</span> <a href="mailto:you@example.com">you@example.com</a></p> */}
    </div>
    <Stamp class="about__stamp" rotate={11} />
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
